    b\xEA l\xE0 \u1ED4N \u0110\u1ECANH ho\u1EB7c B\u1EA4T TH\u01AF\u1EDCNG\r\n\nT\u1EA0I
    SAO D\xD9NG G\u01AF\u01A0NG?\n   - M\u1ED9t s\u1ED1 khuy\u1EBFt t\u1EADt ch\u1EC9
    t\u1EF1 b\u1ED9c l\u1ED9 trong ph\u1EA3n chi\u1EBFu.\n\nVui l\xF2ng l\xE0m vi\u1EC7c
    hi\u1EC7u qu\u1EA3. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i c\xF3 ch\u1EC9 ti\xEAu c\u1EA7n \u0111\u1EA1t.\r\n\u0110\u1EEBng
    c\u1ED1 g\u1EAFng giao ti\u1EBFp v\u1EDBi b\xFAp b\xEA. Ch\xFAng kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3
    nghe b\u1EA1n.\r\n                                            - Ban Qu\u1EA3n
    L\xFD\r -\n"
